    {
      "at": "2026-08-14T22:36:30.775Z",
      "pillar": "constraint",
      "kind": "pas",
      "isThread": false,
      "parts": 1,
      "text": "“We need to post more.”\n\nNo — that’s the symptom.\n\nThe real problem is a hook problem. And more effort on the wrong lever just makes the drop steeper.\n\nFix it at the source: ten posts nobody stops for is still zero.",
      "accounts": [
        "markusreidgt"
      ],
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@markusreidgt/post/DcCZq1VGj_B",
      "metrics": {
        "views": 4,
